{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y对音乐细节的切分和按小节出现的提示不如X细密，部分乐句的起伏、音色变化和情绪转折被压缩了。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的叙述更连贯，人物每一步为什么产生某种期待、顾虑或退缩，都能从前后句中自然理解，右侧感受词也经过筛选，比较容易边听边抓住重点。X的【】强调和按小节出现的感受提示很有价值，尤其在音乐细节上更丰富，但部分短语反复表达相近感受，水波、船、失重等意象叠加过多，容易让观众忙于接收提示而不是理解人物。整体而言，Y在扫读效率、心理因果和叙事连续性上更稳，X则胜在音乐感受的颗粒度和局部细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "76b25645-eaa6-4cbf-a404-87e8a59ca716", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000549586306Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:07:10.833407+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d8f19ad828d63b261432ba614f2977f6723e102c5619e07d1dbd40bb00e207eb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w